#: ../../chapter01.rst:3
msgid "Administration Scope"
msgstr "Administrationsomfang"

#: ../../chapter01.rst:7
msgid "Management"
msgstr "Ledelse"

#: ../../chapter01.rst:9
msgid ""
"In |prodname|, objects that can be managed are defined in the following "
"picture. You can manage objects at different levels from one single "
"management portal."
msgstr "I |prodname| er objekter, der kan administreres, defineret i det følgende billede. Du kan administrere objekter på forskellige niveauer fra ét enkelt administrationsportal."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:16
msgid "Partner Portal"
msgstr "Partnerportal"

#: ../../chapter01.rst:18
msgid ""
"The Partner Portal is used primarily for managing licenses and licenses "
"distribution amongst all of your |prodname| Servers."
msgstr "Partnerportalen bruges primært til at administrere licenser og licensdistribution blandt alle dine |prodname| Servere."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:20
msgid ""
"You can login the partner portal through here: "
"https://partner.centrestack.com/login/. From the Partner Portal you can "
"download the |prodname| software as well as manage the licensing of your "
"Servers."
msgstr "Du kan logge ind på partnerportalen her: https://partner.centrestack.com/login/. Fra Partner Portalen kan du downloade |prodname| softwaren samt administrere licenserne til dine servere."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:24
msgid ""
"Commonly, you will download the |prodname| software, set it up and "
"leverage the built-in 30 day trial time to finish the setup. Towards the "
"end of the trial, you assign licenses from the partner portal to your "
"Server and activate it into a production environment."
msgstr "Almindeligvis vil du downloade |prodname| softwaren, opsætte den og udnytte den indbyggede 30 dages prøveperiode til at færdiggøre opsætningen. Mod slutningen af prøveperioden tildeler du licenser fra partnerportalen til din server og aktiverer den til et produktionsmiljø."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:28
msgid ""
"Both Self-Hosted Servers and Hosted CentreStack Tenants (sync4share) can "
"be managed via the Partner Portal."
msgstr "Både selvhostede servere og hostede CentreStack-lejere (sync4share) kan administreres via Partnerportalen."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:32
msgid "Self-Hosted |prodname|"
msgstr "Self-Hosted |prodname|"

#: ../../chapter01.rst:34
msgid ""
"In the User Interface, the Self-Hosted |prodname| instance is referred to"
" as a Cluster or a Server Farm. A Cluster can be as small as a single "
"Server or scaled out to include multiple Servers in a Server farm."
msgstr "I brugergrænsefladen henvises den selvhostede |prodname| instans til som en Klynge eller et Servergård. En Klynge kan være så lille som en enkelt Server eller skaleret ud til at omfatte flere Servere i en servergård."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:36
msgid "**Hosted CentreStack**"
msgstr "**Hosted CentreStack**"

#: ../../chapter01.rst:38
msgid ""
"In the Partner Portal, you can also manage tenants which are hosted by "
"CentreStack (sync4share). This document doesn't cover Hosted CentreStack."
" Please refer to the Hosted CentreStack Administration Guide "
"(https://www.centrestack.com/Library/HostedCentreStackGuide/index.html) "
"for more information on hosted options."
msgstr "I Partner Portal kan du også administrere lejere, som hostes af CentreStack (sync4share). Dette dokument dækker ikke Hosted CentreStack. Henvis venligst til Hosted CentreStack Administration Guide (https://www.centrestack.com/Library/HostedCentreStackGuide/index.html) for mere information om hostede muligheder."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:42
msgid "**Tenants**"
msgstr "**Lejere**"

#: ../../chapter01.rst:44
msgid ""
"In a |prodname| management interface, most of the time you are managing "
"tenants. It can be a single tenant when deployed for a single company, or"
" it can be multiple tenants. A tenant is a management and billing scope "
"that includes a number of users and a specific amount of storage. It "
"normally maps to a company or a client of yours."
msgstr "I en |prodname| administrationsgrænseflade bruger du det meste af tiden på at administrere lejere. Det kan være en enkelt lejer, når det er udrullet til en enkelt virksomhed, eller det kan være flere lejere. En lejer er et administrations- og faktureringsområde, der inkluderer et antal brugere og en bestemt mængde lagerplads. Det svarer normalt til et firma eller en klient af dig."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:49
msgid "**Users, Devices, File Server Shares**"
msgstr "**Brugere, Enheder, Filserverandele**"

#: ../../chapter01.rst:51
msgid ""
"In each tenant, the objects you manage include Users and Devices as well "
"as File Server Network Shares for Team Folder collaboration (Team "
"Shares)."
msgstr "I hver tenant omfatter de objekter, du administrerer, Brugere og Enheder samt Netværksandele på filservere til samarbejde i Teammapper (Team Shares)."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:54
msgid ""
"This document is focused on the management scope for a Self-Hosted "
"|prodname|. In the server management interface, there are two "
"administration scopes: Cluster Administrator and Tenant Administrator."
msgstr "Dette dokument er fokuseret på ledelsesomfanget for en Self-Hosted |prodname|. I serveradministrationsgrænsefladen er der to administrationsområder: Cluster Administrator og Tenant Administrator."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:59
msgid "Cluster Administrator"
msgstr "Klyngeadministrator"

#: ../../chapter01.rst:61
msgid ""
"The Cluster Administrator can manage cluster-wide functionalities, such "
"as email SMTP server setup and worker node properties etc."
msgstr "Klyngeadministratoren kan administrere funktionaliteter på tværs af klyngen, såsom opsætning af e-mail SMTP-server og egenskaber for arbejdsnode osv."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:64
msgid ""
"In the Deployment Guide, the Cluster Administrator is often referred to "
"as the Master Admin, Root Admin, or just Server Administrator. Even "
"though the Cluster Server Farm can have multiple Servers, most of the "
"time, a server-farm with one single server is sufficient for your use "
"case and your user base."
msgstr "I Udrulningsguiden henvises der ofte til Klyngeadministratoren som Master Admin, Root Admin eller blot Serveradministrator. Selvom Klynge Serverfarmen kan have flere servere, er en server-farm med en enkelt server det meste af tiden tilstrækkelig til dit brugstilfælde og din brugerbase."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:70
msgid "Tenant Administrator"
msgstr "Lejeradministrator"

#: ../../chapter01.rst:72
msgid ""
"Tenant Administrator can manage Tenant-Wide functionalities, such as "
"Group Policies. The Cluster Admin is also a Tenant Admin for the very "
"first Tenant (Default Tenant) so the Cluster Administrator manages both "
"Cluster Administration and Tenant Administration (for the default "
"tenant). In the multiple-tenant case, each Tenant Administrator will be "
"responsible for the Tenant's administration scope."
msgstr "Lejeradministrator kan administrere lejeromfattende funktioner, såsom gruppepolitikker. Klyngeadministratoren er også en lejeradministrator for den allerførste lejer (Standardlejeren), så klyngeadministratoren håndterer både klyngeadministration og lejeradministration (for standardlejeren). I tilfældet med flere lejere vil hver lejeradministrator være ansvarlig for lejerens administrationsområde."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:78
msgid ""
"The Cluster Administrator by default can help each Tenant Administrator "
"manage at the tenant level."
msgstr "Klyngeadministratoren kan som standard hjælpe hver enkelt lejeradministrator med at administrere på lejerniveau."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:80
msgid ""
"In real-world scenarios, the tenant is often mapped to an organization; a"
" client of an MSP or a customer that has many employees."
msgstr "I virkelige scenarier er lejeren ofte knyttet til en organisation; en klient hos en MSP eller en kunde, der har mange ansatte."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:82
msgid ""
"There are two icons related to cluster administration and tenant "
"administration:"
msgstr "Der er to ikoner relateret til klyngeadministration og tenantadministration:"

#: ../../chapter01.rst:84
msgid "Cluster Manager icon"
msgstr "Ikon for klyngeadministrator"

#: ../../chapter01.rst:88
msgid "Tenant Manager icon"
msgstr "Ikon for lejeradministrator"

#: ../../chapter01.rst:94
msgid "Tenant(s) usually map to your organization(s) or client(s)."
msgstr "Lejer(e) svarer normalt til din organisation(er) eller klient(er)."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:96
msgid ""
"If you are logged in as the Default Cluster Admin, you will manage the "
"tenant-level scope from the \"Tenant Manager\" instead of using the "
"\"Tenant Manager icon\"."
msgstr "Hvis du er logget ind som standard Cluster Admin, vil du administrere tenant-niveauet fra \"Tenant Manager\" i stedet for at bruge \"Tenant Manager-ikonet\"."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:102
msgid ""
"1: All the administration work is performed via the web portal inside a "
"web browser. Recommended browsers include Google Chrome first, followed "
"by Firefox, Internet Explorer, Safari, and Opera. (Internet Explorer "
"requires version 9 and above and includes Microsoft Edge Browser)"
msgstr "Al administrationen udføres via webportalen i en webbrowser. Anbefalede browsere inkluderer Google Chrome først, efterfulgt af Firefox, Internet Explorer, Safari og Opera. (Internet Explorer kræver version 9 og derover og inkluderer Microsoft Edge-browseren)"

#: ../../chapter01.rst:104
msgid ""
"2: The very first user who installed the Cluster Server is also the "
"Cluster Admin and Tenant Admin for the Default Tenant. In order for the "
"Cluster Admin to be familiar with the tenant functionality, the Cluster "
"Admin is provided a small 3-user default account (Tenant Account)."
msgstr "2: Den allerførste bruger, der installerede Cluster Serveren, er også Cluster Admin og Tenant Admin for den Standard Tenant. For at Cluster Admin skal være fortrolig med tenant-funktionaliteten, får Cluster Admin en lille standardkonto med 3 brugere (Tenant Account)."

#: ../../chapter01.rst:107
msgid ""
"3: You can start the administration work at any time by pointing your web"
" browser to the Cluster Server's IP Address or DNS name. If you are on "
"the Cluster Server console, you can even use http://localhost to get "
"started."
msgstr "3: Du kan påbegynde administrationsarbejdet når som helst ved at pege din webbrowser mod klynge-serverens IP-adresse eller DNS-navn. Hvis du er på klynge-serverens konsol, kan du endda bruge http://localhost for at komme i gang."

